<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Confirmación de Orden {{orderId}}</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light dark;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f5f7fa;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        table {
            border-spacing: 0;
        }

        img {
            border: 0;
        }

        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
            background: #f5f7fa;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }

        .main {
            background: #ffffff;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 600px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .header {
            background: #111d01;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            color: #1a202c;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .content h2 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #111d01;
        }

        .meta-table {
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .meta-table td {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .meta-table tr:nth-child(odd) {
            background: #f8fafc;
        }

        .products {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 10px 0 24px;
        }

        .products thead th {
            background: #111d01;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .5px;
        }

        .products tbody td {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 10px 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .products tbody tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #e7f1ff;
            color: #111d01;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: .5px;
        }

        .total-box {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .total-line {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 4px 0;
        }

        .grand {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111d01;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #ffffff;
            width: 600px;
            margin: 8px auto 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #6b7280;
            padding: 15px 10px 30px;
        }

        a {
            color: #111d01;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #111d01;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: .5px;
        }

        @media (max-width:620px) {

            .main,
            .footer {
                width: 100% !important;
                border-radius: 0;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 22px 18px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <span
        style="display:none !important; visibility:hidden; opacity:0; color:transparent; height:0; width:0; overflow:hidden;">Resumen
        de tu compra #{{orderId}}</span>

    <table class="wrapper" role="presentation" width="100%">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table class="main" role="presentation">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="header">
                            <h1>Confirmación de Pago</h1>
                            <div style="font-size:13px; margin-top:4px;">Orden #{{orderId}}</div>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="content">
                            <h2>Hola {{userName}}, gracias por tu compra.</h2>
                            <p>Hemos recibido y aprobado tu pago mediante <strong>{{paymentMethod}}</strong>. A
                                continuación encontrarás el detalle de tu orden.</p>

                            <table class="meta-table" role="presentation">
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>ID de Orden:</strong></td>
                                    <td>{{orderId}}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Método de Pago:</strong></td>
                                    <td>{{paymentMethod}}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Dirección de Envío:</strong></td>
                                    <td style="font-weight:600;">{{shippingAddress.street}}</td>
                                    <td style="text-align:center;">{{shippingAddress.city}}</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <table class="products" role="presentation">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th style="text-align:left;">Producto</th>
                                        <th style="text-align:center;">Cant.</th>
                                        <th style="text-align:right;">Precio</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    {{#each products}}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="font-weight:600;">{{title}}</td>
                                        <td style="text-align:center;">{{quantity}}</td>
                                        <td style="text-align:right;">$ {{price}}</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    {{/each}}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <div class="total-box">
                                <div class="total-line grand">
                                    <span>Total Pagado</span>
                                    <span> ${{totalAmount}}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <p style="margin:24px 0 14px;">Puedes revisar el estado de tu orden iniciando sesión en tu
                                cuenta.</p>
                            <p style="text-align:center;">
                                <a class="btn" href="{{portalUrl}}">Ver mi orden</a>
                            </p>
                            <p style="font-size:12px; color:#64748b; margin-top:28px;">
                                Si tienes preguntas responde a este correo o contáctanos en soporte.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
                <div class="footer">
                    ©2025 Todos los derechos reservados.
                    <br>
                    No responda este correo, es generado automáticamente.
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>